From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:22:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] ryGT: stage workers (R5), shared recorder obtains (R6),
 last-match shader search (R7), DIAG-114

- R5 (SHADGT_STAGE_WORKERS=N, off by default): the buffer stage dispatches plans to N worker
  threads with their own rings and forwards jobs in order; refused plans are redone; written
  ranges are registered in job order; the recorder settles ranges other workers are syncing.
- R6: with workers, the recorder's common obtains take the cache lock shared.
- R7 (perf 133, on): GetProgram tries the permutation the last search found first. Command
  thread program matching -30% in Tokyo races (no fps change: the recorder limits).
- DIAG-114 (SHADGT_DIAG_TIMELINE=1): per-submit timeline and recorder idle periods.
Full Tokyo races, 3 runs each: default ~34 fps, 1 stage worker ~32, 3 workers ~32; the stage
stays off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
